an algebraic space:\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004> where <MATH_0005> is a groupoid in algebraic spaces\nover <MATH_0006> such that <MATH_0007> are flat and locally of finite presentation, and\n<MATH_0008> is an equivalence relation,\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0009> where <MATH_0010> is a groupoid scheme\nover <MATH_0011> such that <MATH_0012> are flat and locally of finite presentation, and\n<MATH_0013> is an equivalence relation,\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0014> is a sheaf and there exists an algebraic space <MATH_0015> and a morphism\n<MATH_0016> which is representable by algebraic spaces,\nsurjective, flat and locally of finite presentation,\n<STRUCT_0006> <MATH_0017> is a sheaf and there exists a scheme <MATH_0018> and a morphism\n<MATH_0019> which is representable by algebraic spaces or schemes,\nsurjective, flat and locally of finite presentation,\n<STRUCT_0007> <MATH_0020> is a sheaf, <MATH_0021> is representable by algebraic spaces,\nand there exists an algebraic space <MATH_0022> and a morphism <MATH_0023> which is\nsurjective, flat, and locally of finite presentation, or\n<STRUCT_0008> <MATH_0024> is a sheaf, <MATH_0025> is representable,\nand there exists a scheme <MATH_0026> and a morphism <MATH_0027> which is\nsurjective, flat, and locally of finite presentation.\n<STRUCT_0009>\n<STRUCT_0010>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d41d18ee29fbbf40d8ab11e56d8e2fc041d51cf87c76d2d26e669a4c965697f4", "unit_id": "inventory:bootstrap:04S6:theorem/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "locked-English-reference:criteria:inventory:criteria:05XQ:lemma/0001:criteria-lemma-surjection-space-of-sections", "hash": "sha256:347cf6d363cccf7414465964fdd4afbf7d922ad9211d569d6c633c8f378b091f", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 43220, "byte_start": 42880, "file": "criteria.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:6856f150531fc2882be09d499d770806cace8937d031c7af0334fa9b1ecb56c2", "line_end": 1113, "line_start": 1103}, "owner_tag": "05XQ", "parent_tag": "05XZ", "requested_